theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 16
text = "HOW TO PLAY:

1. WASD to move
2. LMB to shoot
3. SHIFT/RMB to dodge
4. SPACE to use SUPER
5. Hit asteroids/enemies to charge SUPER
6. Destroy the asteroid shower
7. Clear the enemy drones to advance
8. Defeat ENEMY LEADERs to gain HP
9. Defeat all ENEMY LEADERS to WIN!
10. R to restart
11. ESC to pause

Press 'How To Play' to close panel."
